# Vars of the cable check lab: the vars of the cable check ISO
# (hack/check-iso/vars; TestCableCheckLabVars keeps them in sync) plus an
# expected cabling with one wrong port (eth2 is cabled to leaf01 eth2, not
# eth3) and the file and bm4x-report sinks.
MODE=check
NETWORK_MODE=links
LLDP_PROFILE=bm4x-cablecheck
CHECK_HOLD=until-poweroff
LLDP_NEIGHBOR_WAIT=90s
CHECK_PROFILES=health,cabling
CHECK_RESULT_SINKS=file,bm4x-report
CHECK_EXPECTED_CABLING='[{"interface":"eth1","switch":"leaf01","port":"eth1"},{"interface":"eth2","switch":"leaf01","port":"eth3"}]'
